      "data": {
        "text": "**Defining the Cloud Platform**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Google Cloud's Vertex AI as the specific platform for this implementation. This crucial choice will be baked into the Python file's structure. The name will reflect the platform.\n\n\n**Specifying the Model Choice**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on the file structure: `invoke_platform_model.py` it is! Within that, I plan to integrate Google Cloud Vertex AI client libraries directly. My main focus is on specifying a concrete model, like `gemini-pro`, for the invocation. I need to make sure the program will initialize a Vertex AI client and then call the model with some test input.\n\n\n",
